    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThe ultimate city pied-à-terre, Apartment 24 is a bright and generously proportioned two-bedroom apartment occupying a top-floor position within this refurbished Georgian building, complete with secure underground parking.\n\nThe apartment offers beautifully presented, light-filled accommodation with attractive sash windows enjoying a peaceful rear aspect over the gardens and elegant Georgian architecture of Merrion Square.\n\nDunloe Hall occupies one of Dublin's most prestigious and convenient addresses, directly opposite Government Buildings and adjacent to The Merrion Hotel and Patrick Guilbaud's renowned Michelin-starred restaurant.\n\nA particularly valuable feature is the secure underground parking space located behind electronic security gates, a rare asset in this prime city centre location.\n\nResidents enjoy immediate access to many of Dublin's finest cultural, recreational and dining amenities. Merrion Square, St Stephen's Green, the National Gallery of Ireland and the National Museum of Ireland are all within a short stroll, while Grafton Street offers an extensive selection of high-end shopping and retail. Some of the city's most established restaurants, including Patrick Guilbaud, Pearl Brasserie and The Unicorn, are also just moments away, making this an exceptional base from which to enjoy city living."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nwith high ceilings, laminate floor and door to hotpress.\n\nLiving / Dining Room: - \nwith two sash windows, high ceilings, alcove storage, attractive marble fireplace and gas fire. Open to:\n\nKitchen: - \nwith a range of fitted wall and floor units, tiled floor, tiled splashback, oven, hob, extractor fan, washer/dryer, and fridge freezer.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nbeautiful bright double bedroom with two sash windows, high ceiling and laminate floor.\n\nBedroom 2: - \ndouble room with sash window, high ceiling and laminate floor.\n\nBathroom: - \nfully tiled with bath, overhead shower, wash hand basin and wc.\n\n"
      },
      {
